  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">"This bookwork is a U.S. address bookwork of 1984. It is an alphabetically ordered work of 24 double sided accordion folded pages. Noted in vibrant colors are abbreviations for each of the 50 U.S. state names,  their older postal zip codes which are hyphened, and their telephone area codes of 1985.  Also abbreviated are words that appear often in place names.  The mixed and layered letters and numbers are integrated into map/landscape images.  Many American first names are in alphabetical groupings over muted and textural landscapes. Each page interfolded into itself and is mounted on board."--Letter from artist.</subfield>
  </datafield>
